WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
PartTrellis — Part-aware image-to-3D.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
One image becomes a part-aware 3D asset.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.667
Image-guided PBR materials.

00:16.667 --> 00:23.667
Generated parts separate and reassemble.

00:23.667 --> 00:30.333
Hand-authored joints animate the microwave door and dials.

00:30.333 --> 00:37.000
The swing assembly moves around its joint.

00:37.000 --> 00:43.667
Individual wheels and hub caps rotate.

00:43.667 --> 00:50.333
Generated geometry in an application demonstration.

00:50.333 --> 00:55.333
PartTrellis — generated parts, image-guided materials.
